    "note": [
        {
            "structuredValue": [],
            "parallelValue": [],
            "groupedValue": [],
            "value": "MemoryDrive allows users store the preferences that define their rental\r\ncar driving experience on a “drive”--that is, the MemoryDrive smartphone application. They can\r\nthen use any vehicle with the system installed, and the vehicle will adjust to match the specified\r\nsettings. The application allows users to adjust various aspects of their driving environment by\r\ninputting information about themselves and defining their ideal driving experience.\r\nMemoryDrive creates a safer, more personalized driving experience by allowing users to\r\ncustomize preferences such as seat position, headrest height, autonomy level, mirror position,\r\nwindow tint, and the sensitivity of the gas/brake pedals and the steering wheel. The driver’s\r\nsecondary experience is also enhanced by pre-set preferences for radio and other media, a\r\nconvenient navigation system, local traffic and weather reporting, and the ability to take and\r\nmake hands-free phone calls with a connected smartphone. All of these preferences can be\r\nestablished before ever stepping foot in a MemoryDrive car, and adjusting a car to match these\r\nsettings requires nothing more than the smartphone app. A driver can use any rental car with the\r\nsystem installed, and it will feel just like his or her own car.",
            "type": "abstract",
            "identifier": [],
            "note": [],
            "appliesTo": []
        },
